# 📡️ P2-FG1: REAL binary diff frame, replacing F6's `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary
# shortcut (`../../🦀️component.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`) -- `IfcDiff` was one of 4 of
# stdio's 7 FG1 standards still on that shortcut per this wave's own P2-FG1 census (md/xml/dxf
# already did the same real upgrade this wave, proving it's achievable). Same structural reasoning
# as the sibling `../../🧬️mutations/💾️binary/📡️component.protocol.semio` (read that file's comment
# for the full `DslField`/recursion rationale -- it applies identically here, `IfcEntitiesDiff`/
# `IfcEntityDiff`/`IfcArgsDiff` are the diff-shaped twin of the same `IfcValue`/`IfcEntity`
# recursion problem).
#
# `format u8` + `flags u8` (bit0..3 = `file_description`/`file_name`/`file_schema`/`entities`
# presence, same order the text grammar's token list uses) as two REAL fixed fields, then each
# present field's payload in that order as one trailing `bytes` chain. `file_description`/
# `file_name`/`file_schema` (flat `Vec<IfcValue>`) and `entities`' own `removed`/`modified.id`/
# `added.index` keys are real field-by-field binary at the Rust layer
# (`enc_ifc_value_list_bin`/`enc_entities_diff_bin` in `../../🦀️component.rs`, reusing
# `store::pack_rt::write_varint_u64`/`store::ByteReader`) -- only `IfcValue::Aggregate`/
# `TypedValue`'s self-recursion into `Vec<IfcValue>` cannot be re-modeled field-by-field AT THIS
# DIALECT LAYER, because `Prim::Ref` (the only construct that could describe that self-recursion
# here) unconditionally errors during `walk_protocol` (`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`, recipe §5 --
# confirmed unchanged through every FG-wave pilot, not fixed by this wave either). Same
# honest-boundary treatment the plan prescribes: opaque at the protocol layer, genuinely structured
# (and round-trip-tested) at the Rust layer. Filed as `mechanism_gaps` in this wave's report
# (non-blocking; worked around locally exactly as described here, same as json/csv/zip/png/binary/
# md/xml/dxf).
dialect protocol
protocol stdio.ifc.diff
version 1
schema stdio.ifc
start record

framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field flags u8
chain payload bytes
